<title>SYRIA: Syria to celebrate Eid el-Fitr on Saturday.</title>
<headline>Syria to celebrate Eid el-Fitr on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria on Friday announced Saturday would be the first day of the Eid el-Fitr holiday marking the end of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan, an official statement said.</p>
<p>It said all government offices would be closed for three days and work would resume on Tuesday.</p>
